	"_comment": "Trip-supply tiers, best first per category (wiki-verified 2026-07-20). placement:utility = fight-relevant gear that is neither worn nor carried (spellbook capes) - the bank layout gives it a third strip below the cross and inventory. ids[0] is the display id (4-dose potion / cooked food); the full list joins the bank filter so every dose matches. detect:false = only selectable explicitly, never auto-picked. venomousMonsters = the wiki Venom page's exhaustive inflictor list (Ungael 'Spider' omitted: the bare name is too generic to match safely). Cure Me (2 astral 2 cosmic 1 law, Lunar) converts venom to poison; the Prayer book cures poison for prayer points and venom to poison for up to 50 while a holy/hallowed symbol is worn (wiki 2026-09-08; Apathy's ironman ask) - both detect:false, choices only. antipoison (2026-09-09, replacing the dead bring chips): poisoning-not-venomous mobs (poisonMonsters, name tokens - the Kings' spinolyps, KQ, Sarachnis, Scorpia); tiers best first, ids from gameval; Cure Me and the prayer book are choices here too.",
