	"_noCannon_comment": "The cannon supply is skipped when any mob on the selection is here (Andrew 2026-10-20: 'suggesting dwarf multicannon for barrows even though it's not allowed'). Exact lower-case names, never substrings: the wiki's cannon_immune = Immune monsters matching a corpus name exactly (Bucket infobox_monster, 2026-10-20); bosses whose arenas the Dwarf multicannon page's Prohibited areas list names (Abyssal Nexus; Brutus arena; Bryophyta's lair; Callisto's Den; Cerberus' Lair; Gemstone Crab's location; Hespori; Kraken Cove; Karuulm (wyrm and Hydra areas); Ungael (Vorkath area); Vet'ion's Rest; Zulrah's Shrine; Scurrius' Lair; Ruins of Tapoyauik; Shellbane Gryphon Cave; Mor Ul Rek / Fight Cave; Wyvern Cave; Revenant Caves); the bosses that destroy a cannon (the God Wars Dungeon, the Kalphite Queen, the King Black Dragon, the Thermonuclear smoke devil); and the Barrows brothers on Andrew's in-game word (the wiki marks them not cannon-immune; its prohibited list is non-exhaustive).",
